Step 1: Turning the potion of object detection to water

Dip a potion in a fountain to turn it into water.  The first time
you will just dilute the potion; the second time you'll get water.
If you have real water nearby (like burst pipes or a moat) you can
use that instead if you can walk on water.  That way you don't use
up those fountains.       


Step 2: Making the water holy 

Put all your water on an altar of your god.  Make sure your god is
in a good mood; sacrifice something if you're not sure and check
the message back.  Stand on the altar and pray.


